# Admin scope

Editing under `web/admin/`:

- UI: **`admin-ui-implementation.mdc`** + skill `ui-shadcn-animate-ui` (chạy CLI trong `web/admin`).
- **Không** sửa `src/**` API — ghi contract `docs/design/admin-*.md` / types FE cho backend agent.
- **Không** đọc `design/*.design.md` learner trừ khi user @ file (token/màu: copy CSS từ `web/app`).
- Lean reads: `.cursor/skills/lean-context/SKILL.md`.
- Dev: `pnpm dev:admin` (port 3001); env `web/admin/.env.local` + `ADMIN_API_KEY`.

## Dashboard home — dữ liệu

- **Contract:** `src/modules/admin-dashboard/admin-dashboard.summary.schema.ts` — admin UI import `@dailytaka/admin-dashboard-contract`, mock `satisfies AdminDashboardSummary`.
- **Mặc định mock:** `mock-summary.ts` + `getAdminDashboardSummary()` — **không** gọi `GET /v1/admin/dashboard/summary` trừ khi user **yêu cầu rõ** nối API (dùng `fetch-admin-dashboard-summary.ts`).
- Chi tiết: `docs/design/2026-11-05-admin-dashboard-data.md`.
